<div class="landing-shell">
    <div class="landing-grid">
        <section class="landing-story">
            <span class="landing-eyebrow">Soc Ops · Social Bingo</span>
            <h1 class="landing-title">Tres variantes de diseño, una sola forma de romper el hielo.</h1>
            <p class="landing-copy">
                La portada mezcla el dramatismo de <strong>Midnight Stage</strong>, la claridad de <strong>Split Story</strong>
                y la modularidad de <strong>Magazine Grid</strong> para abrir workshops, mixers y sesiones de onboarding con más presencia.
            </p>

            <div class="landing-actions">
                <button
                    @onclick="OnStart"
                    class="landing-cta">
                    Start session
                </button>

                <div class="landing-stats" aria-label="game summary">
                    <div>
                        <strong>25</strong>
                        <span>prompts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>5-in-row</strong>
                        <span>to win</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Zero setup</strong>
                        <span>just tap and play</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-stage-card">
            <div class="landing-panel-label">Midnight Stage</div>
            <h2>Una apertura con foco, contraste y energía.</h2>
            <p>
                Un hero oscuro con luz puntual para hacer que el CTA y el arranque de la dinámica
                se sientan más memorables.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-how-card">
            <div class="landing-panel-label">Split Story</div>
            <h2>How it works</h2>
            <ol class="landing-steps">
                <li>
                    <strong>Scan the room</strong>
                    <span>Find someone who matches the prompt on a square.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Mark the board</strong>
                    <span>Tap the square after you confirm the match.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Complete the line</strong>
                    <span>Build a full row, column, or diagonal to call bingo.</span>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="landing-grid-card">
            <div class="landing-panel-label">Magazine Grid</div>
            <div class="landing-modules">
                <article>
                    <span>Mixers</span>
                    <strong>Fast icebreaker</strong>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <span>Onboarding</span>
                    <strong>Shared context</strong>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <span>Workshops</span>
                    <strong>Live participation</strong>
                </article>
                <article>
                    <span>Events</span>
                    <strong>Easy replayability</strong>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public EventCallback OnStart { get; set; }
}
